      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Check if the SmartHub is properly plugged into a power source.\n2. Restart the SmartHub by unplugging it for 10 seconds and plugging it back in.\n3. Ensure the SmartHub is connected to the correct Wi-Fi network.\n4. Reset the SmartHub to factory settings (note: this will erase all custom settings).\n5. Check for any software updates for the SmartHub and install them if available.\n6. Contact Zenith support if the issue persists.",
