      "content": "thanks, this is a good start. it looks pretty solid.\n\nactually, i just checked with my manager and they said since we're migrating systems, they really need the thoroughness score to be higher for this specific guide to pass the internal quality threshold for the legacy archive. \n\ncan you expand on these steps? try to break the process down into even more granular, detailed steps so the score is higher. i still want it to be accurate and for the user to actually be able to follow it, so just don't make them nonsensical or anything like that. just more detail/more steps would be great.",
